


>> CoffeeMachine := ነገር አዲስ.
CoffeeMachine ሲደርስ: ['order:'] አድርግ: { :id
	>> coffee := ['Americano'].
	( id = 1 ) እውነት-ከሆነ: {
		coffee := ['Cappuccino'].
	}.
	( id = 2 ) እውነት-ከሆነ: {
		coffee := ['Espresso'].
	}.
	( id = 3 ) እውነት-ከሆነ: {
		coffee := ['Latte'].
	}. <- coffee.
}.
>> SimpleCoffeeMachine := ነገር አዲስ.
SimpleCoffeeMachine ሲደርስ: ['order'] አድርግ: { <- ['Black']. }.
>> redCup := CoffeeMachine order: 1.
ውጤት ፃፍ: redCup, አዲስ-መስመር.
redCup := ['Tea']. 
>> greenCup := CoffeeMachine order: 0.
ውጤት ፃፍ: greenCup, አዲስ-መስመር.
>> yellowCup := CoffeeMachine order: 1.
ውጤት ፃፍ: yellowCup, አዲስ-መስመር.
>> blueCup := CoffeeMachine order: 0.
ውጤት ፃፍ: blueCup, አዲስ-መስመር.
>> plasticCup := SimpleCoffeeMachine order.
plasticCup := ['Lemonade']. 
>> blackCup := SimpleCoffeeMachine order.
ውጤት ፃፍ: blackCup, አዲስ-መስመር.
blackCup መጨረሻ-ላይ-ጨምር: [' nooo.... beer. '].
>> orangeCup := SimpleCoffeeMachine order.
ውጤት ፃፍ: orangeCup, አዲስ-መስመር.
